超华尔街预期的2.397亿美元，营收增长主要来自过往收购及新开直营门店的收入增量。但受成本攀升拖累，当期净利润降至460万美元，合每股收益0.37美元，去年同期净利润为730万美元、每股收益0.48美元；调整后每股收益0.82美元，低于FactSet调研分析师预期的1.01美元。当期总营业成本上涨25%，综合管理费用小幅上升2.8%。旗下两大品牌Applebee’s同店销售额增0.9%，外带外卖占总销23%", "author": "环球市场播报", "keywords": []}, "extraction": {"entrypoint_url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "raw_html_path": null, "list_rank": 1, "list_size": 194, "captured_at": "2026-11-05T00:26:57.606850+08:00", "method": "滚动新闻"}, "quality": {"status": "valid", "score": 0.976, "grade": "A", "flags": [], "review_required": false, "downstream_usable": true}, "content": "Dine Brands公布第三季度总营收上涨15%至2.489亿美元，超华尔街预期的2.397亿美元，营收增长主要来自过往收购及新开直营门店的收入增量。但受成本攀升拖累，当期净利润降至460万美元，合每股收益0.37美元，去年同期净利润为730万美元、每股收益0.48美元；调整后每股收益0.82美元，低于FactSet调研分析师预期的1.01美元。当期总营业成本上涨25%，综合管理费用小幅上升2.8%。旗下两大品牌Applebee’s同店销售额增0.9%，外带外卖占总销23%；IHOP可比销售额增0.8%，外带外卖占比21%。(AI生成)", "author": "环球市场播报", "section": "滚动新闻", "keywords": [], "hot_features": {"source_prominence": {"list_rank": 1, "list_size": 194, "source_priority": 6, "source_tier": "T1", "entrypoint": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/roll/", "captured_at": "2026-11-05T00:26:57.606850+08:00"}, "engagement_metrics": {"read_count": null, "view_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "like_count": null, "favorite_count": null, "share_count": null, "repost_count": null, "collected_at": "2026-11-05T00:26:57.606850+08:00", "source": "sina_finance_detail_html+sina_comment_api", "available_fields": ["comment_count"], "missing_fields": ["read_count", "view_count", "like_count", "favorite_count", "share_count", "repost_count"], "quality_flags": [], "raw": {"sina_comment_api": {"sina_comment_count": {"total": 0, "show": 0, "thread_show": 0, "qreply_show": 0, "qreply": 0}, "api_url": "https://comment5.news.sina.com.cn/cmnt/count?format=json&newslist=cj%3Acomos-nixqxhk9249172", "comment_channel": "cj", "comment_id": "comos-nixqxhk9249172"}}}}, "diagnostics": {"content_hash": "6668e9f280b5c83dfba49bdb83372ec7e7fefc1b536ac2f68aef25d759f87c48", "title_hash": "47e5089e